  "description": "A short-range weapon that sprays five gouts of burning fuel per burst. Each gout consumes 0.2 chemfuel; a full twenty-unit tank supplies twenty bursts. The spray burns and ignites targets and ground, endangering nearby allies. Heat passes through Holtzman fields. Drop the weapon on accessible ground for a hauling worker to refill its native chemfuel tank, then equip it again. For an unowned weapon, select Allow refueling first. New weapons have empty tanks.",
